COPYRIGHT HOLDER DURING "IN FORMATION" PERIOD
============================================================================

The Asociación Micelia para la Soberanía Computacional Cooperativa is in
the process of formal constitution under Spanish associative law (expected
completion: 2026-Q3 to 2026-Q4).

Until the Asociación is formally registered:

- Copyright in contributions accepted under `docs/CLA.md` is held by the
  individual contributors, with the operational license granted to the
  Asociación (in formation) as Steward.
- The interim copyright holder for project-administrative purposes (logo,
  trademark application, repository administration) is the founder and
  Nodo 1: Jessicache, acting on behalf of the future Asociación.
- Upon formal constitution of the Asociación, all administrative rights
  held by the founder transfer to the Asociación by a public deed of
  transfer that will be archived at `docs/legal/transfer-deed.md` and
  signed by the founder.
- If the Asociación fails to be formally constituted by 2027-06-30, the
  CLA `docs/CLA.md` §5 reversion mechanism activates: contributors may
  reclaim their individual licenses by a public vote per §4 procedure.

This disclosure exists to (a) avoid uncertainty for downstream users about
who holds enforceable rights today, and (b) document the planned transfer
chain before it happens.

