============================================================================
AI SOVEREIGNTY
============================================================================

Per docs/AI_SOVEREIGNTY_POLICY.md, the Micelia orchestrator MUST function
with open-weight models (Llama, Mistral, Qwen, etc.). Proprietary models
(GPT, Claude, Gemini) are optional and must degrade gracefully. Modules
exclusively dependent on proprietary providers will not be accepted into
the core.
